{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃淑蔓（Feanna）前晚（9日）舉行新歌《餓》MV首播發布會，與逾百名暱稱「蔓頭」的歌迷一同見證新作面世。</p><p>她在現場首度公開演唱《餓》及《Hey Feanna》，並與觀眾進行鬥快吃炸雞遊戲。</p><p>勝出的男粉絲獲她親自餵食炸雞，令全場氣氛高漲。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T07:38:11.898441+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T06:52:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:17:39.674778+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"73d420eeb9a5fe303fc51af533716e0e8f41649b54f4fb756ee3db0a54178d8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}